# promise: #820
# Tab on "youtube" with Settings ▸ Advanced ▸ Command bar ▸ "Fill the command bar with the site’s color" off,
# its default: the bar keeps Arc's neutral fill, the site only in the pill and in the one-second wash that
# fades, as in Arc. The pale red bar in #820's screenshot is that setting's fill, (246,223,223) on a light bar
# (command-bar-site-color), so it was on there.
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=site-color-off
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://commandbar?query=youtube
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarScope=enter
wait 2
expect-log command bar scope enter: YouTube, fill default
reject-log command bar scope enter: YouTube, fill .(4B2323|F6DFDF)
cra://dismiss
